summary: QMC integration tests
description: |
    Build QMC from source and exercise its integration tests on a disposable
    VM. Missing prerequisites must fail the test.
test: bash ./smoke.sh
framework: shell
duration: 10m
require:
    - bzip2
    - coreutils
    - crun
    - gcc
    - golang-github-cpuguy83-md2man
    - iproute
    - iputils
    - json-c-devel
    - libmnl-devel
    - make
    - meson
    - nftables
    - nftables-devel
    - ninja-build
    - procps-ng
    - python3
    - systemd
    - systemd-devel
    - util-linux
id: 029a6f52-744c-4b0c-a037-14596d2166d6
